"""ant-gene-stats-precompute — fleet-wide `gene_stats_index.parquet`.

Precomputes per-(dataset, gene) expression statistics for a "hot" gene set
so `/api/gene_stats_all` can serve most queries from a single parquet
instead of fanning out over 185 duckdbs.

Architecture (mirrors `ant-module-variability`):

  * Per-dataset parquet cache under
    ``<h5adstore>/_gene_stats_cache/<db_id_flat>/genestats.parquet``.
    Fresh while its expression source is unchanged: the by-gene layer
    parquet of the default layer (else the ``.duckdb`` holding the layer)
    and the resolved ``default_layer`` value, both recorded in the cache's
    parquet metadata (:func:`cache_is_fresh`). An ``.md`` edit or an
    obs-only duckdb rewrite does not invalidate it; a changed
    ``default_layer`` or a re-ingested layer does.
  * Two-phase build:
      Phase 1 — per dataset, compute top-N most-variable genes over the
                default layer (native STDDEV_POP over the by-gene parquet).
      Phase 2 — union those sets → **global hot set** — then for every
                dataset compute stats for **every** hot gene (so every
                dataset can answer for every hot gene, no server-side
                fallback for the hot set).
  * `--hot-set FILE` — override the auto-discovered hot set (one gene per
    line). Useful for pinning the user's favourite genes.
  * `--only db_id` — recompute one dataset's cache; the aggregate rebuild
    then re-concatenates.
  * Output row schema (canonical column order):
      ``dataset, gene, layer, n_cells, n_nonzero, pct_nonzero, mean, std,
        cv, mean_nonzero, std_nonzero, median_nonzero, q10_nonzero,
        q90_nonzero, max, mean_expr_layer, rank_mean, scaled_mean,
        src_fingerprint``. ``src_fingerprint`` (one value per dataset) lets
        ant-serve skip rows whose source files changed since this run; see
        ``lib/index_freshness.py``.

Usage:
  ant-gene-stats-precompute [--only DB1,DB2,...] [--top-n N]
                            [--hot-set FILE] [--out PATH]
                            [--workers N] [--force] [--dry-run]
                            [--list-stale] [--h5adstore-root DIR]
"""
